  "id": "codex-web-search-duplicate-id-live",
  "concept": "opaque-malformed-and-blank-records",
  "description": "A Codex CLI 0.160.1 web_search line repeats item.id: serde writes ThreadItem.id (the exec processor's item_N) and then the flattened WebSearchItem.id (the app-server item's own id). Strict parsing refuses the line, so it is retained verbatim as an opaque record with both ids; in exactly this declared form it is also read as a tool call under the first id, never the last. The search action is the request arguments and the results are the result content.",
